{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "やほきち"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近人間観察する時ちいかわのキャラを当てはめて勝手に楽しんでる しもだ いずき です"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/moblnMtkE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "欲しいですか？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "食べたいので私が食べちゃいます。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "( '༥' )ŧ‹”ŧ‹”"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちいかわパーク行ってきたよん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "推しはくりまんじゅう！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "被ったよーん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かぶとむし発見①"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobpEE1In.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob9sXWFy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobAvWzey.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かぶとむしも推しなの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かぶとむし発見②"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobOVr6Xs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobVo8wvY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "推しと推しの共存😭♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は転生系やダンジョン系のアニメが好きなんですけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その中でも何故かゴブリンが好きで、ちいかわにゴブリンが出てくるんです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんな可愛いゴブリン家に1匹欲しいなぁ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて思いながらアニメを観ていてついにキーホルダーをゲット出来ました✌️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのあとねカフェに行ったの！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛い星のカフェ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっかり完食しましたァ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日の私は食べるスピードが速くてパクパク食べ終わりました😋"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これの前に大きいたこ焼きも食べた🐙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お外で食べたんだけどお祭り感あった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後にお祭り行ったの中一だからなんかすごく懐かしい気持ちもあったし切なくもあったなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "感じ方が変わってました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人になったのかも私(*´ ˘ `*)ｳﾌﾌ♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういえばこの日の服は滅多に着ないワンピース！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アメリカンなワンピースなの！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポイントは大きいボタン！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ベルトを付けたくて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しだけリメイクしたよぉ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後日しっかりちいかわの映画観に行ったよぉ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サイコー✌️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·✧••┈┈┈••✧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "18thシングルのミーグリの第1次応募受付が今日の14:00からスタートしましたァ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://fortunemusic.jp/hinatazaka_202609/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "話せるの楽しみだなぁ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんな服を着るか考える時間がすごく楽しい！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·✧••┈┈┈••✧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近嬉しかったことがあったのっ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それはね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がその日読んで面白かった漫画を勧めれたことです💚💛( ˶¯ ꒳¯˵)ｴﾍﾍ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの辺で〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ばいばいちゃ〜"}], "source": "official"}